The four LiberationSans-*.ttf files are unmodified copies from the upstream
binary archive. LICENSE_LIBERATION is the archive's original LICENSE file.

vite.config.ts uses these files for PDF.js's standard font assets in both
development and production. This replaces PDF.js's bundled Liberation Sans
1.07.4 fonts and their GPLv2 license notice; other PDF.js assets retain their
upstream files and licenses.

PDF.js upgrades do not update these pinned fonts. To update Liberation Sans,
add the four unmodified Sans fonts and license from an official release in a
new version directory, update this provenance information and the path in
vite.config.ts, and verify PDF rendering for all four styles.
